    dmo:evidenceQuote "Intermediate basal insulin administration of isophane (NPH) insulin at the start of the feed, with a further dose likely to be required at the midpoint of the feed if feed duration is ≥16 hours" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

