    dmo:evidenceQuote "a single doses of soluble human insulin, administered 20 minutes prior to the start of the bolus feed can be given." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/medication/soluble-insulin> a dmo:Medication ;
