<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/adjust-insulin-dose-proportions-based-on-vriii-rate-patterns-during-feed> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Adjust insulin dose proportions based on VRIII rate patterns during feed" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "adjust-insulin-dose-proportions-based-on-vriii-rate-patterns-during-feed" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Take note of the VRIII rates. If there is a pattern of higher insulin rates at certain points in the feed then this should be reflected in the prescribed insulin doses. For example, if insulin rates are higher in the first 4 hours of the feed and lower in the last 4 hours of the feed then the insulin doses should be proportionally bigger at start of the feed and lower for doses nearer the end of the feed." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Take note of the VRIII rates. If there is a pattern of higher insulin rates at certain points in the feed then this should be reflected in the prescribed insulin doses. For example, if insulin rates are higher in the first 4 hours of the feed and lower in the last 4 hours of the feed then the insulin doses should be proportionally bigger at start of the feed and lower for doses nearer the end of the feed." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/adjustment-of-insulin-regimen-after-admission> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Adjustment of Insulin Regimen After Admission" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "adjustment-of-insulin-regimen-after-admission" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "In some cases a person’s ability to self manage their insulin regimen, their insulin requirements or oral intake may have changed considerably during the admission. The ward team needs to consider if the previous insulin regimen is appropriate and consult with the DIT if unsure." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "In some cases a person’s ability to self manage their insulin regimen, their insulin requirements or oral intake may have changed considerably during the admission. The ward team needs to consider if the previous insulin regimen is appropriate and consult with the DIT if unsure." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

