<https://example.org/dmo/id/recommendation/pre-mixed-biphasic-30-70-insulin-for-continuous-24-hours-feed> a dmo:Recommendation ;
    rdfs:label "Pre-mixed biphasic (30/70) insulin for continuous 24-hours feed" ;
    dmo:populationScope "people with Type 1 or insulin deficient diabetes" ;
    dmo:recommendationId "pre-mixed-biphasic-30-70-insulin-for-continuous-24-hours-feed" ;
    dmo:recommendationStrength "Unspecified" ;
    dmo:recommendationType "Treatment" ;
    dmo:statement "Pre-mixed biphasic (30/70) insulin at start and halfway through feed if >16 hours. Where two doses required, take TFD and divide with either a 50/50 dose split or where glucose levels spike after start of the feed, you can give 60% of the required total daily dose administered at start of the feed and 40% at the mid point dose" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Pre-mixed biphasic (30/70) insulin at start and halfway through feed if >16 hours. Where two doses required, take TFD and divide with either a 50/50 dose split or where glucose levels spike after start of the feed, you can give 60% of the required total daily dose administered at start of the feed and 40% at the mid point dose" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

