    dmo:evidenceQuote "Pre-mixed biphasic (30/70) insulin at start and halfway through feed if feed duration >16 hours. Where two doses required, take TFD and divide with either a 50/50 dose split or where glucose levels spike after start of the feed, consider 60% of the required total daily dose administered at start of the feed and 40% at the mid point dose" ;
