    dmo:evidenceQuote "Prescribe the regimen as a 50/50 dose split of the TFD or where glucose levels spike after start of the feed, consider 60% of the required total feed dose (TFD) administered at start of the feed and 40% at the mid point dose" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

