<https://example.org/dmo/id/riskFactor/pancreatic-exocrine-insufficiency> a dmo:RiskFactor ;
    rdfs:label "Pancreatic Exocrine Insufficiency" ;
    dmo:evidenceNote "文档中明确指出胰腺外分泌功能不全可能影响喂养中碳水化合物的吸收速率，从而影响整体血糖控制。" ;
    dmo:name "Pancreatic Exocrine Insufficiency" ;
    dmo:riskCategory "NonModifiable" ;
    dmo:riskFactorCode "pancreatic-exocrine-insufficiency" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Pancreatic exocrine insufficiency may also be present. This may influence the rate of carbohydrate absorption of the feed and influence overall glucose control." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Where pancreatic exocrine insufficiency is also present ensure the correct digestive enzymes are prescribed. This may influence the rate of carbohydrate absorption of the feed and influence overall glucose control." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "•  Where pancreatic exocrine insufficiency is also present ensure the correct digestive enzymes are prescribed." ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "Where pancreatic exocrine insufficiency is also present ensure the correct digestive enzymes are prescribed. This may influence the rate of carbohydrate absorption of the feed and influence overall glucose control" ;
