    dmo:urgency "Urgent" ;
    dmo:evidenceQuote "People with varying degrees of neurological injury or impairment may potentially mask the symptoms of hypoglycaemia – for instance confusion, drowsiness, odd behaviour, speech difficulty or un-coordination." ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://example.org/dmo/id/guidelineSource/jbds_05_enteral_feeding_guideline_april_2024> .

